#Golden_Path_OneBase_Posting_Rule<[
Базис:
  OneBase golden path is complete at this stage when the Work Graph has a reviewable, executable design package for one real posting-rule change.
  This package does not modify OneBase source code; it prepares the first implementation PR/patch with bounded context, evidence and verification gates.
Вектор:
  Scenario: add Склад as a dimension of РеализацияТоваров gross-profit posting so ВаловаяПрибыль can be analyzed by warehouse.
  Source scenario: domains/onebase/workflows/change-posting-rule.bvc.
  Artifact mapping: domains/onebase/artifact-mapping.bvc and domains/onebase/examples/realization-posting-step-atom-draft.example.json.
  Verification policy: domains/onebase/verification-command.bvc.
Цель:
  A worker can claim the next implementation task, open only the relevant OneBase slice, produce a small patch, and record deterministic evidence without rediscovering the scenario.

Проверки:
  scenario, artifact mapping, StepAtomDraft input, worker flow, evidence model and verification command are tied together
  Go absence is modeled as an environment blocker, not a OneBase code failure
  first implementation DoD is explicit and does not require another design pass

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  domain.id: onebase
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  onebase.document: РеализацияТоваров
  onebase.rule: gross-profit-by-warehouse
  work.source: onebase-posting-rule-golden-path
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Scenario_Context<[
Базис:
  РеализацияТоваров already carries header field Склад and uses it for stock movements, while the gross-profit register path is currently described as item-level analytics.
Вектор:
  Intended change: add Склад to ВаловаяПрибыль movements and related reporting/query surface while preserving totals.
  Expected invariant: total Выручка, Себестоимость and gross profit stay the same before and after grouping by warehouse.
  Preserved behavior: FIFO batch selection, ОстаткиТоваров by Номенклатура/Склад, ПартииТоваров расход and Взаиморасчеты debt movement.
Цель:
  The business result is warehouse-level gross-profit analysis without changing stock, cost or settlement semantics.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Artifact_Context_Slice<[
Базис:
  The implementation worker should not scan the whole OneBase tree when the relevant slice is known.
Вектор:
  Read first: ../onebase/examples/trade/documents/реализация_товаров.yaml, ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os and ../onebase/examples/trade/registers/валовая_прибыль.yaml.
  Then read downstream readers only as needed: ../onebase/examples/trade/reports/валовая_прибыль.yaml and ../onebase/examples/trade/widgets/валовая_прибыль_kpi.yaml.
  Related register invariants: ОстаткиТоваров, ПартииТоваров and Взаиморасчеты are trace context but should not be changed unless verification proves the rule requires it.
  Trace refs: onebase-realization-golden-path, onebase-change-posting-rule and onebase-golden-path-command.
Цель:
  The context slice is broad enough to implement the rule and narrow enough to review safely.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  onebase.document_file: ../onebase/examples/trade/documents/реализация_товаров.yaml
  onebase.posting_script: ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os
  onebase.register.refs: ВаловаяПрибыль, ОстаткиТоваров, ПартииТоваров, Взаиморасчеты
  work.target_files: ../onebase/examples/trade/registers/валовая_прибыль.yaml, ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os, ../onebase/examples/trade/reports/валовая_прибыль.yaml
  trace.status: verified
]>

#StepAtomDraft_Task_Input<[
Базис:
  The next implementation task should be expressible as StepAtomDraft instead of an open-ended prompt.
Вектор:
  profile: work_item.
  work.id: onebase-implement-gross-profit-warehouse-dimension.
  basis: РеализацияТоваров posting uses Склад for stock movement, but gross-profit analytics need warehouse separation.
  vector: update ВаловаяПрибыль schema, posting movement and report/query surface so gross profit can be grouped or filtered by Склад; add or update the smallest deterministic test/fixture available in OneBase.
  goal: warehouse-level gross-profit analytics with unchanged FIFO, stock and settlement behavior.
  checks: gross-profit movement includes Склад; totals remain compatible; FIFO, stock and debt behavior are unchanged; verification command evidence is recorded.
Цель:
  A provider-neutral worker receives a concrete task input that can become a backlog atom or provider prompt without reinterpreting the design artifacts.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  work.template_id: onebase-implement-gross-profit-warehouse-dimension
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Expected_Worker_Flow<[
Базис:
  Worker execution must follow the provider-neutral adapter boundary and leave Work Graph as source of truth.
Вектор:
  Claim onebase-implement-gross-profit-warehouse-dimension only after this golden path task is done.
  Build Worker Input v1 from current Work Graph snapshot, this golden path artifact, artifact mapping, scenario design, verification policy and a memory slice for OneBase artifact facts.
  Allow file reads/writes only inside the declared OneBase target files plus the smallest test/fixture files selected during implementation.
  Produce Worker Output v1 with patchSummary, changed files, evidence records, verification result or blocker, and a transition request.
  Runtime records evidence and applies status gates; the worker does not silently mark the task done.
Цель:
  The first real implementation PR can be executed by any provider without hidden session state.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  protocol.refs: agent-worker-adapter, evidence-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Evidence_And_Verification_Model<[
Базис:
  The golden path needs distinguishable evidence for design completion, code changes, command verification and environment blockers.
Вектор:
  Design evidence: this file exists and links scenario, mapping, StepAtomDraft input, worker flow, evidence and verification policy.
  Change evidence for implementation: changed OneBase files, patch summary and business assertion added or updated.
  Verification evidence: preflight command go version from ../onebase, then primary command go test ./... from ../onebase with timeout 120s.
  Blocked state: if go version is missing or non-zero, record evidence type=blocker/status=blocked with preflight output and do not claim OneBase verification passed or failed.
  Work Graph verification for this design package: npm test in D:/Work/IDE/work graph must pass before onebase-posting-rule-golden-path can be marked done.
Цель:
  Operators can tell whether the system proved the design package, proved the OneBase code patch, or hit a local toolchain blocker.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  verification.id: onebase-golden-path-command
  verification.preflight_command: go version
  verification.primary_command: go test ./...
  verification.cwd: ../onebase
  verification.timeout_seconds: 120
  trace.status: verified
]>

#First_Implementation_DoD<[
Базис:
  The next task is the first real OneBase implementation patch, not another design artifact.
Вектор:
  Done requires: Склад is represented in ВаловаяПрибыль schema/movements; gross-profit report/query surface can separate warehouses; KPI totals remain compatible; FIFO, stock and debt behavior are unchanged.
  Done also requires evidence: changed artifact refs, deterministic test or fixture assertion where feasible, go version preflight, go test ./... result or a clear environment blocker if Go is unavailable.
  Review boundary: changing shared posting runtime, FIFO algorithm or unrelated registers requires a separate Work Graph task.
Цель:
  The first implementation PR has a precise acceptance boundary and can be reviewed as a small business-rule patch.

Метки:
  atom.profile: work_item
  work.template_id: onebase-implement-gross-profit-warehouse-dimension
  golden_path.id: onebase-posting-rule-gross-profit-warehouse
  trace.status: verified
]>
